This is a Flutter app ("Enhancify", AI photo enhancer). Rules:
- Dart 3 / latest stable Flutter, Material 3, provider for state.
- All user-tunable values live in lib/config/app_config.dart; AI models in lib/config/ai_models.dart.
- Colors only from AppColors in lib/theme/app_theme.dart (red / maroon palette). Keep the dark UI.
- Reuse widgets in lib/widgets/common.dart (PillButton, ProBadge, DarkCard, showSnack).
- Every async UI flow must check `mounted` / `context.mounted` after awaits.
- Free-tier limits go through AppState.remaining / incrementUsage and ensureQuota().
- Never put the Replicate token in code; use --dart-define or the server/ proxy.
- Run `flutter analyze` and `flutter test` after changes.
